{"page":77,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:1","surah":4,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّاسُ ٱتَّقُوا۟ رَبَّكُمُ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَكُم مِّن نَّفْسٍ وَٰحِدَةٍ وَخَلَقَ مِنْهَا زَوْجَهَا وَبَثَّ مِنْهُمَا رِجَالًا كَثِيرًا وَنِسَآءً ۚ وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ ٱلَّذِى تَسَآءَلُونَ بِهِۦ وَٱلْأَرْحَامَ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ كَانَ عَلَيْكُمْ رَقِيبًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"People, be mindful of your Lord, who created you from a single soul, and from it created its mate, and from the pair of them spread countless men and women far and wide; be mindful of God, in whose name you make requests of one another. Beware of severing the ties of kinship: God is always watching over you.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"4:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسُ","en_gloss":"mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsu","verse_key":"4:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"Fear","transliteration":"ittaqū","verse_key":"4:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبَّكُمُ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbakumu","verse_key":"4:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"4:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"خَلَقَكُم","en_gloss":"created you","transliteration":"khalaqakum","verse_key":"4:1"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:1"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نَّفْسٍۢ","en_gloss":"a soul","transliteration":"nafsin","verse_key":"4:1"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٰحِدَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"single","transliteration":"wāḥidatin","verse_key":"4:1"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَخَلَقَ","en_gloss":"and created","transliteration":"wakhalaqa","verse_key":"4:1"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنْهَا","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"4:1"},{"pos":12,"ar":"زَوْجَهَا","en_gloss":"its mate","transliteration":"zawjahā","verse_key":"4:1"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَبَثَّ","en_gloss":"and dispersed","transliteration":"wabatha","verse_key":"4:1"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِنْهُمَا","en_gloss":"from both of them","transliteration":"min'humā